  "title": "Gartner Announces Pricing of $800 million of Senior Notes",
  "summary": "STAMFORD, Conn. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Nov. 13, 2025-- Gartner, Inc. (NYSE:IT) (“Gartner,” “we” or “our”) announced today that it priced its registered public offering (the “Offering”) of $800 million aggregate principal amount of its senior notes, consisting of $350 million principal amount of 4.950%",
